WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.245
October, nineteen eighty-seven. A strategy game spreads across the world, one Usenet post at a time.

2
00:00:07.470 --> 00:00:17.518
In the computer centres of the universities, students compile it, and rule kingdoms of elves, dwarves, orcs and humans from green-screen terminals.

3
00:00:17.743 --> 00:00:29.884
It is no board game: it is a world of epic fantasy, with magic, heroes and monsters. Every turn, all the kingdoms move at once.

4
00:00:30.109 --> 00:00:32.646
Forty years later, Conquer is back.

5
00:00:32.871 --> 00:00:39.170
No installation. No shell account. Just your browser. Try it now.

